  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bufumbo Coffee Processing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture. Crops Coffee.Beneficiaries: 542 smallholder farmers of whom 170 are women...Project funds will be used to establish a 500 metric ton storage facility secured with fencing. Some of the funds will be used for procurement of motorized pulping Machines to add value to the Association coffee. Other project funds will be used for working capital for procurement of farm inputs and for paying farmers cash when they deliver their coffee to the cooperative. .</narrative>
  </description>
